//--------------------------------------------------------------------
{MasterCode explained}
* The first 3 lines never change but i do not know what they do
* The last 4 lines are all addresses - remove the 1st digit, class it as 0x or 2x and then you can find your new region/ version.
* The last 2 lines are just address+values, and they are just default values.
* it is entirely likely the only line that is actually needed is Line 4
* not all codes port correctly between versions, regions, and formats, pnach -> codebreaker etc... I do not know why
	- Examples: - NTSC has a working infinite health, i have not been able to create this for PAL neither in codebreaker nor using pnach.
			    - 60/50hz patch did not seem to do much when used with codebreaker.
				- i tested a vehicle spoawn switch code to change the in game btn combo spawn vortex to spawn trashmaster and it spawned the romero // in correct by 34
				+ Money cheat worked which confirms the master code worked.
