2027BFB4 10200002 --> 20040000   = 0 star
2027BFB4 10200002 --> 20040032   = 1 star
2027BFB4 10200002 --> 240400B4   = 2 star
2027BFB4 10200002 --> 24040228   = 3 star
2027BFB4 10200002 --> 10200000  | 240404B0  = 4 stars
2027BFB4 10200002 --> 24040960   = 5 stars
2027BFB4 10200002 --> 240411F8  = 6 stars | 240423F0


